# TouchDesigner
# website: https://derivative.ca/
# docs: https://docs.derivative.ca/
# description: Derivative TouchDesigner visual development platform backups, autosaves, cache, and Python runtime artifacts.

# Backups and autosaves
**/Backup/
**/CrashAutoSave.*
*.dmp

# Incremental saves and autosaved files
**/*.*.toe
*Autosave*.toe

# TouchDesigner import cache
**/TDImportCache/

# Logs
*.log
**/logs/

# Embedded Python artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo